# MyEfreiCard — Project Walkthrough

## Overview
A **Kotlin Android** app built with **Jetpack Compose** and **Material 3** — a digital student ID card for Efrei Paris that replaces the physical card with a modern mobile experience.

## Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[MainActivity] --> B[MainScreen - Scaffold]
    B --> C[Floating BottomNavBar]
    B --> D[NavGraph]
    D --> E[CardScreen]
    D --> F[ProfileScreen]
    D --> G[ScheduleScreen]
    D --> H[AccessScreen]
    E --> I[SampleData]
    F --> I
    G --> I
    H --> I
```

