## 4 Screens

### 🪪 Card Screen
- Blue-to-purple gradient student ID card
- Animated **pulsing NFC scan button** with concentric ring animation
- Student info (name, program, ID, year, INE)
- Validity date + enrollment/status chips

### 👤 Profile Screen  
- Gradient header banner with avatar
- **Contact Information** — email, phone, address
- **Academic Information** — student ID, year, DOB, GPA, major, minor, dates
- **Emergency Contact** — name, relationship, phone

### 📅 Schedule Screen
- Gradient summary banner (total credits + total courses)
- Course cards with code, day badges, credits circle, professor, time, location

### 🔐 Access Screen
- Green gradient "All Facilities Active" status banner
- Facility cards with colored icons (Library, Gym, Dining, Lab, Health, Auditorium)
- Active status indicators + hours

## Visual Design Features
- 🎨 **Blue→Purple gradient** card & banners
- ✨ **Animated pulsing NFC button** with infinite transition
- 🏗️ **Floating bottom nav bar** with rounded corners and shadow
- 🎯 **Color-coded facility icons** with background circles
- 📐 **Consistent card shadows** with colored ambient light
- 🔄 **Smooth nav transitions** with animated color changes

## How to Build

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Open the project in **Android Studio** (Hedgehog or later recommended).

1. Open Android Studio → `File > Open` → select `/home/gaspard/Documents/Antigravity/MyEfreiCard/`
2. Wait for Gradle sync to complete (it will download the wrapper + dependencies)
3. Connect a device or start an emulator (API 26+)
4. Click **Run ▶️**

## Tech Stack
- **Kotlin** 1.9.22
- **Jetpack Compose** (BOM 2024.02.00)
- **Material 3** with custom theme
- **Navigation Compose** for screen routing
- **Material Icons Extended** for rich iconography
- **Adaptive Icons** for launcher
